 *linux-64*, *osx-64*, and *osx-arm64* platforms. Install the ``hoomd`` package from the conda-forge_
 channel:
 
-.. code-block:: bash
+.. tab:: Pixi
 
-    micromamba install hoomd=6.1.1
+    .. code-block:: bash
+
+        pixi add hoomd=6.1.1
+
+.. tab:: Micromamba
+
+    .. code-block:: bash
